@startuml
autoactivate on
autonumber

actor "User" as User
participant ":System" as System

activate User

== Save album to Library ==
User -> System: asks to save the album to the Library
alt saved
  System --> User: informs success and shows the Remove from Library button
else storage error
  System --> User: informs the error
end

== Remove album from Library ==
User -> System: asks to remove the album from the Library
alt removed
  System --> User: informs success and shows the Save to Library button
else storage error
  System --> User: informs the error
end

note right of System
  The Library is stored on the device only.
  It does not change the Spotify account.
end note

@enduml
